### ========================================
### ORDER
### harga total dihitung server dari service_prices x quantity
### ========================================

### GET ALL ORDERS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders


### CREATE ORDER (1 invoice, banyak item; servicePriceId = id dari /api/service-prices)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "cash",
  "items": [
    { "servicePriceId": 1, "quantity": 2.5 },
    { "servicePriceId": 2, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}


### UPDATE ORDER (item lama diganti seluruhnya)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "transfer",
  "items": [
    { "servicePriceId": 1, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}


### DELETE ORDER
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1

